  "prefLabel": "Env-A 305.03 Measurement for CO Attainment Determination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 305.03 Measurement for CO Attainment Determination. For the purpose of determining attainment of the primary ambient air quality standards for CO specified in Env-A 305.01, carbon monoxide in the ambient air shall be measured by either:\n\n(a) A reference method based on 40 CFR 50 Appendix C and designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53; or\n\n(b) An equivalent method designated in accordance with 40 CFR 53.\n\nSource. #6227, eff 4-25-96; ss by #8054, eff 2-28-04; ss by #10173, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13382, eff 5-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a300.html"
